---
import LandingLayout from '../layouts/LandingLayout.astro';
---

<LandingLayout title="Contact - 呂依璇 Elaine Lu" currentPath="/contact">
  <div class="page contact-container">
    <div class="contact-header">
      <h1 class="contact-title">聯絡我</h1>
      <p class="contact-intro">
        如果你對資訊安全感興趣，或有想討論的研究專案，歡迎透過以下方式與我聯繫。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="contact-grid">
      <!-- Email -->
      <a href="mailto:elainelu0813@gmail.com" class="contact-card">
        <div class="contact-icon email-icon">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z" />
            <polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>電子郵件</h3>
        <p>需要正式一點的合作或討論，可以用 Email 聯絡我</p>
        <span class="contact-action">發送郵件 →</span>
      </a>

      <!-- GitHub -->
      <a href="https://github.com/smadonkuan" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="contact-card">
        <div class="contact-icon github-icon">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
            <path
              d="M12 0c-6.626 0-12 5.373-12 12 0 5.302 3.438 9.8 8.207 11.387.599.111.793-.261.793-.577v-2.234c-3.338.726-4.033-1.416-4.033-1.416-.546-1.387-1.333-1.756-1.333-1.756-1.089-.745.083-.729.083-.729 1.205.084 1.839 1.237 1.839 1.237 1.07 1.834 2.807 1.304 3.492.997.107-.775.418-1.305.762-1.604-2.665-.305-5.467-1.334-5.467-5.931 0-1.311.469-2.381 1.236-3.221-.124-.303-.535-1.524.117-3.176 0 0 1.008-.322 3.301 1.23.957-.266 1.983-.399 3.003-.404 1.02.005 2.047.138 3.006.404 2.291-1.552 3.297-1.23 3.297-1.23.653 1.653.242 2.874.118 3.176.77.84 1.235 1.911 1.235 3.221 0 4.609-2.807 5.624-5.479 5.921.43.372.823 1.102.823 2.222v3.293c0 .319.192.694.801.576 4.765-1.589 8.199-6.086 8.199-11.386 0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12z"
            />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>GitHub</h3>
        <p>GitHub 還在沉睡中，等我哪天想起來可能會更新一下</p>
        <span class="contact-action">訪問 GitHub →</span>
      </a>

      <!-- LinkedIn -->
      <a
        href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/elaine-lu-115952392/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="contact-card"
      >
        <div class="contact-icon linkedin-icon">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
            <path
              d="M20.447 20.452h-3.554v-5.569c0-1.328-.027-3.037-1.852-3.037-1.853 0-2.136 1.445-2.136 2.939v5.667H9.351V9h3.414v1.561h.046c.477-.9 1.637-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.601 0 4.267 2.37 4.267 5.455v6.286zM5.337 7.433c-1.144 0-2.063-.926-2.063-2.065 0-1.138.92-2.063 2.063-2.063 1.14 0 2.064.925 2.064 2.063 0 1.139-.925 2.065-2.064 2.065zm1.782 13.019H3.555V9h3.564v11.452zM22.225 0H1.771C.792 0 0 .774 0 1.729v20.542C0 23.227.792 24 1.771 24h20.451C23.2 24 24 23.227 24 22.271V1.729C24 .774 23.2 0 22.222 0h.003z"
            />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>LinkedIn</h3>
        <p>想認識、交流或聊聊合作機會，也可以在 LinkedIn 找我</p>
        <span class="contact-action">訪問 LinkedIn →</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="contact-footer">
      <p>期待與你的合作 ✨</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</LandingLayout>

<style>
  .contact-container {
    max-width: 100%;
  }

  .contact-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .contact-title {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .contact-intro {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    word-break: keep-all;
    overflow-wrap: break-word;
  }

  .contact-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .contact-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .contact-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 4px;
    background: var(--accent);
    transform: scaleX(0);
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  }

  .contact-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }

  .contact-card:hover::before {
    transform: scaleX(1);
  }

  .contact-icon {
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .email-icon {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
    color: white;
  }

  .github-icon {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a1a 0%, #333 100%);
    color: white;
  }

  .linkedin-icon {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0077b5 0%, #00a0dc 100%);
    color: white;
  }

  .contact-card:hover .contact-icon {
    transform: scale(1.1) rotate(5deg);
  }

  .contact-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .contact-card p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .contact-action {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--accent);
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .contact-card:hover .contact-action {
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }

  .contact-footer {
    text-align: center;
    padding-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .contact-footer p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .contact-title {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }

    .contact-intro {
      font-size: 1rem;
      max-width: 100%;
      padding: 0 1rem;
    }

    .contact-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.25rem;
    }

    .contact-card {
      padding: 1.75rem 1.25rem;
    }

    .contact-icon {
      width: 56px;
      height: 56px;
    }
  }
</style>